{"product":{"id":7413067382827,"title":"Premier Kaluga Hybrid Caviar","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"paragraph\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eWith its generously sized grains and rich chocolate brown to dark amber color, Kaluga Hybrid (also known as The River Beluga) offers fantastic value for the price. It’s one of the most popular caviars in the world today, known for its consistency, versatility, mild flavor, and large, beautiful pearls. A hybrid of Amur River sturgeons Kaluga (Huso dauricus) and Japanese sturgeon (Acipenser schrenckii), this caviar delivers a delicate, buttery flavor with a very mild, briny finish. If you enjoy the firm texture and mild taste of Osetra, you’ll love this ecologically friendly, farm-raised caviar.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eEach jar is hand-packed to order and carefully inspected for optimal color, size, freshness, flavor, and texture. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"Caviar Star","product_type":"physical","created_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:04-04:00","handle":"amber-dynasty-royal-kaluga-caviar","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:18:35-04:00","published_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:04-04:00","template_suffix":"caviar-variants","published_scope":"global","tags":"Best, By_Country, Caviar, China, Chinese, Chinese Caviar, Daurenkii, Huso caviar, Imported Caviar, Kaluga Caviar, Kaluga Hybrid Caviar, River Beluga, Sturgeon, Sturgeon Caviar","variants":[{"id":41890804465707,"product_id":7413067382827,"title":"1oz","price":"79.00","sku":"K1","position":1,"compare_at_price":"90.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"1oz","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:04-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:18:35-04:00","taxable":false,"barcode":"713336002852","grams":104,"image_id":35100603121707,"weight":0.23,"weight_un